  "Twapza transcribes and captions videos in dozens of languages, including English, Spanish, Dutch, German, French and Arabic. The app itself is available in six languages.": "Twapza transcribeert en ondertitelt video's in tientallen talen, waaronder Engels, Spaans, Nederlands, Duits, Frans en Arabisch. De app zelf is beschikbaar in zes talen.",
